   <text:p text:style-name="P88" loext:marker-style-name="T12"><text:span text:style-name="T12">When the user launches the app you will normally want to display a contents menu, giving them an easy way to select books in the app. The contents menu contains a list of images and titles.</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T12"/></text:p>
